# Agent config. Tracked where it is shared policy — permission deny rules, Cursor
# rules, skill content and the symlinks each agent reads it through. Ignored where
# it is personal. The contents must be globbed rather than the directory itself:
# git cannot re-include a child of an excluded directory.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/**/*.log
.cursor/*
!.cursor/rules/
